@net_users_api_HostAddress = http://localhost:8080

### HTML table
GET {{net_users_api_HostAddress}}/

### All users
GET {{net_users_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/users
Accept: application/json

### Existing user
GET {{net_users_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/users/1
Accept: application/json

### Missing user: 404 with {"error":"User not found"}
GET {{net_users_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/users/missing

### Create synthetic user (run once per application process)
POST {{net_users_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{"id":"workshop-example","fullName":"Workshop Example","emoji":"sample"}

### Update the synthetic user; the route ID wins
PUT {{net_users_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/users/workshop-example
Content-Type: application/json

{"id":"ignored","fullName":"Updated Example","emoji":"updated"}

### Delete the synthetic user: 204 No Content
DELETE {{net_users_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/users/workshop-example

### Repeat the delete: 404 with {"error":"User not found"}
DELETE {{net_users_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/users/workshop-example

### Confirm the deleted user is missing: 404 with {"error":"User not found"}
GET {{net_users_api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/users/workshop-example
